bounded by 224 meet the floor `1/113`.  Cover-capacity certificate: 42 parts, capacities
summing to 111 < 112, using 186 witness times (split style). -/
theorem dense_floor_m112_split (v : Fin 112 → ℤ) (hv : ∀ i, 0 < v i)
    (hinj : Function.Injective fun i => (v i).toNat)
    (hden : ∀ i, (v i).toNat ∈ Finset.Icc 1 224) :
    1 / (113 : ℝ) ≤ ML v := by
  have h := floor_of_cover_capacity (k := 111) (t := 42) (N := 186) v hv hinj
    (by simpa using hden) CRS112.pf CRS112.qf CRS112.hq_all CRS112.bf CRS112.hbad_all
    CRS112.Uf CRS112.cf CRS112.hcover_all CRS112.hcap_all CRS112.hsum_all
